TWEAK_NAME="Boot profiler"
TWEAK_RISK="low"
TWEAK_EXPERIMENTAL=1
TWEAK_DESCRIPTION="Installs a read-only boot runtime into /data/opencmu/boot.d that logs the uptime at which the HMI process appears, wlan0 exists, hostapd is running, the stock start_wifi_ready flag is created and a CarPlay session is established, then a steady-state snapshot and a DONE line. It starts and stops nothing and edits nothing; it writes only its own log. Requires 60-startup-hook."
